{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55707","headline":"明自己颂 · 本先","name":"明自己颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旷大劫来只如是，如是同天亦同地。\n同地同天作麽形，作麽形兮无不是。\n（同前。\n）（按：以上三颂皆爲参德韶後作，德韶卒于吴越纳土前，故收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}